'''Giants''' was a [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] esports organization with teams in [[:counterstrike:Giants Gaming|Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]], [[:leagueoflegends:Giants Gaming|League of Legends]], [[:rainbowsix:Giants Gaming|Rainbow Six]], [[:rocketleague:Giants Gaming|Rocket League]] and VALORANT.

On December 14<sup>th</sup>, 2023, Giants merged with [[Excel Esports]], creating [[GIANTX]].

==History==
Giants first entered ''VALORANT'' on June 2020, and has since become one of the most successful Spanish orgs in the game, reaching top finishes in both local and European tournaments. 
{{See also|Giants/History|l1=History of Giants}}

